**4. MockLog.java:343-351 — `PatternAndExceptionSeenEventExpectation.match` swallows partial matches silently**
```java
boolean exceptionMatches = event.getThrown() != null
    && event.getThrown().getClass() == clazz
    && event.getThrown().getMessage().equals(exceptionMessage);

if (exceptionMatches) {
    if (patternMatches) {
        seenLatch.countDown();
    }
}
```
If pattern matches but exception doesn't (or vice versa), the latch is never counted down → test times out with no diagnostic about *which* part failed. Should either split into two expectations or log mismatch details.
